        "x": -93,
        "y": 537
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The script returns a small dataset object: each item is a sequence and its sorted version, both integer token ids of length 10. TensorDataset cannot carry those targets, since it stores number targets as floats and class targets as one label per row.\n\n腳本回傳一個小型 dataset 物件：每筆資料是一條序列和它排序後的版本，都是長度 10 的整數 token id。TensorDataset 裝不下這種目標，因為它把數值目標存成浮點數，把類別目標當成每列一個標籤。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "gen",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 837
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
