      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Layer editor: Embedding (10 digits -> 64), PositionalEncoding, TransformerEncoder (2 layers, 4 heads, feed-forward 128), Linear (64 -> 10). The output is one score per digit at every position, [batch, 10, 10], and LMCrossEntropyLoss scores all 10 positions at once.\n\n圖層編輯器：Embedding（10 個數字 -> 64）、PositionalEncoding、TransformerEncoder（2 層、4 個 head、前饋 128）、Linear（64 -> 10）。輸出是每個位置對每個數字的分數，形狀 [batch, 10, 10]，LMCrossEntropyLoss 一次評分全部 10 個位置。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
